Come here!

831
01:10:30,886 --> 01:10:32,555
Maybe I'm on a roll...

832
01:10:32,596 --> 01:10:34,599
...and I'll kill every damn Sawyer I see.

833
01:10:41,022 --> 01:10:43,192
Jed, Jed...

834
01:10:44,983 --> 01:10:49,197
<i>Jed... Are you okay down there?

835
01:10:51,865 --> 01:10:52,867
<i>Jed?

836
01:10:52,991 --> 01:10:54,494
<i>Come on, now.

837
01:10:58,540 --> 01:10:59,500
Hold on.

838
01:10:59,582 --> 01:11:02,209
Come on, we've got you. We've got you, Jed.

839
01:12:19,994 --> 01:12:23,207
This will hold it together while it heals...

840
01:12:25,500 --> 01:12:27,336
All right, you're going to feel this...

841
01:12:27,460 --> 01:12:28,960
I'm going to pull it pretty tight.

842
01:12:37,803 --> 01:12:39,097
All right...

843
01:12:45,101 --> 01:12:46,311
Jed...

844
01:13:20,218 --> 01:13:21,762
I'll help you.

845
01:13:23,930 --> 01:13:25,850
I swear.

846
01:13:27,933 --> 01:13:30,437
Untie me, please...

847
01:13:31,729 --> 01:13:33,106
Please...

848
01:13:34,023 --> 01:13:35,316
Why?

849
01:13:42,113 --> 01:13:44,409
What were you going to do to me?

850
01:13:46,995 --> 01:13:48,539
I don't know...

851
01:13:53,960 --> 01:13:57,921
I'm sorry, I am...

852
01:14:07,431 --> 01:14:09,185
Jesus Christ!

853
01:14:11,477 --> 01:14:12,896
Let's go...

854
01:14:24,616 --> 01:14:26,493
<i>Nubbins, come here.

855
01:14:38,463 --> 01:14:39,757
Bring your brother something to eat.

856
01:14:39,798 --> 01:14:41,048
All right.

857
01:14:47,595 --> 01:14:49,473
<i>They're gone! They're gone!

858
01:14:54,061 --> 01:14:55,688
Go, go...

859
01:15:03,194 --> 01:15:05,614
No!

860
01:15:05,697 --> 01:15:06,991
Leave her alone!

861
01:15:07,366 --> 01:15:08,785
No.

862
01:15:09,952 --> 01:15:11,870
Hurry, bring him.

863
01:15:21,045 --> 01:15:22,345
You messed with the wrong family!

864
01:15:22,380 --> 01:15:24,843
Yeah, you're proud of this damn family, aren't
you?

865
01:15:26,007 --> 01:15:27,051
Jed!

866
01:15:30,053 --> 01:15:31,431
Jed!

867
01:15:43,526 --> 01:15:45,404
Oh, fuck!

868
01:15:52,159 --> 01:15:54,454
What are you going to do?

869
01:16:05,172 --> 01:16:06,799
It's not over, boy!

870
01:16:07,049 --> 01:16:08,342
Goddamn it!

871
01:16:09,758 --> 01:16:11,552
This isn't over, damn it! You hear me?

872
01:16:11,634 --> 01:16:14,598
Jed, what have I told you about strangers?

873
01:16:14,764 --> 01:16:16,725
They fill your ears with lies...

874
01:16:16,766 --> 01:16:18,643
Show them who you are, Jed.

875
01:16:19,935 --> 01:16:22,439
Look what that man did to your face!

876
01:16:28,068 --> 01:16:29,653
Jackson, don't do it!

877
01:16:31,447 --> 01:16:33,116
No!

878
01:16:33,199 --> 01:16:35,243
Shut up. You're next, you hear me?

879
01:16:35,284 --> 01:16:36,244
Fuck you!

880
01:16:36,744 --> 01:16:38,372
No!

881
01:16:45,960 --> 01:16:47,171
No!

882
01:17:52,402 --> 01:17:53,820
Go, go, go! Get her now!

883
01:17:53,855 --> 01:17:54,697
Go get her!

884
01:17:56,239 --> 01:17:58,993
Jed, remember what I told you? Go get her.

885
01:17:59,200 --> 01:18:00,119
Get her, Jed!

886
01:18:01,453 --> 01:18:03,080
Nobody messes with our family!

887
01:19:51,893 --> 01:19:54,105
Help me!

888
01:19:57,315 --> 01:20:00,111
No!

889
01:20:18,712 --> 01:20:20,297
Jackson, don't do this!

890
01:20:21,630 --> 01:20:23,967
Please, don't do this!

891
01:20:25,092 --> 01:20:26,636
I tried to help you...

892
01:20:27,011 --> 01:20:28,805
That's all I ever tried to do.

893
01:20:29,055 --> 01:20:30,432
You know that, right?

894
01:20:31,140 --> 01:20:33,518
Listen to me, it's not too late...

895
01:20:33,976 --> 01:20:35,769
We can still get out of here together.

896
01:20:36,060 --> 01:20:37,812
That bitch is a liar, Jed!

897
01:20:38,395 --> 01:20:39,856
She doesn't care about you...

898
01:20:40,314 --> 01:20:42,068
Kill her! Kill her now!

899
01:20:42,108 --> 01:20:43,861
Please don't listen to her.

900
01:20:44,819 --> 01:20:46,238
Please.

901
01:20:46,696 --> 01:20:48,157
I know there's good in you...

902
01:20:48,615 --> 01:20:49,741
I've seen it.

903
01:20:50,407 --> 01:20:53,620
Please listen to me. This isn't you, Jackson!

904
01:20:54,870 --> 01:20:56,039
This isn't you!

905
01:20:56,580 --> 01:20:58,167
It's your crazy mother!

906
01:20:58,583 --> 01:20:59,710
It's her...

907
01:21:15,643 --> 01:21:17,187
That's my boy!

908
01:21:17,728 --> 01:21:19,437
You did good, Jed.

909
01:21:23,107 --> 01:21:25,068
You made your mama proud.

910
01:21:28,028 --> 01:21:31,784
<i>No!

911
01:23:53,796 --> 01:24:49,352
<i>Leatherface (2017)
Subtitles by TaMaBin
